Heart of Magic Librarian - @DESIGN_TITLE@ design (add-on) @PROJECT_VERSION@
==========================================================================

The @DESIGN_TITLE@ design for the Heart of Magic panel. The main mod ships one design, Skald;
each other design is an add-on like this one.

Requires: Heart of Magic Librarian @PROJECT_VERSION@ or later.

Install: with Mod Organizer 2 like any other mod (install this archive, enable the mod). Its
files (@DESIGN_FOLDERS@) go into Data as they are.

Use: in the panel, Settings > UI Display > Design, pick "@DESIGN_TITLE@".

Uninstall: disable or remove the mod. A saved choice of @DESIGN_TITLE@ then shows Skald, and
comes back when the add-on is installed again.

Licence: MIT, like the main mod (@DESIGN_LICENSE_FILE@).@DESIGN_NOTICE_LINE@
